02)--RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([CAST(o.id AS Int64)@1], 4), input_partitions=1
03)----ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, CAST(id@0 AS Int64) as CAST(o.id AS Int64)]
04)------DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]
05)--RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([order_id@1], 4), input_partitions=5
